## Long-Term Vision
State of Dissent is being developed as a system-driven narrative experience where:

- Player choices affect both personal survival and world state  
- Dissent dynamically reshapes the environment  
- Relationships (starting with Grandpa) act as emotional anchors  
- Multiple endings emerge based on player decisions  

